    IT asset disposal covers the full end-of-life workflow for corporate IT — not just 'get the old laptops picked up', but the whole chain: inventory, secure data destruction, disposition (buyback / redeploy / recycle), documentation, and audit-ready records. This page is the entry point for offices that need more than a routine pickup but do not yet have a formal ITAD engagement.
  </p>

